// # core/mem — Linear Arena + ARC + Alignment
//
// Logline: The O(1) bulk-reset linear arena, the deterministic ARC (atomic ref-counted), and the 64-byte aligned payload allocator (OO_PAYLOAD_ALIGN = 64).
//
// Beats:
//   1. weak.h — OoControlBlock + OoWeakRef + OO_FLAG_* values.
//   2. weak.c — the C11-atomic retain/release semantics.
//   3. arena.c — linear arena (create/alloc/reset/destroy).
//   4. alloc.c — bulk allocator that backs the arena.
//   5. align.c — 64-byte aligned payload primitive.
//
// ──▓▓ core/mem ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: Pillar 7 — deterministic, no GC ::
